        {"zh": "我一跃越过小沟", "en": "One leap clears the little ditch."},
        {"zh": "我绕着树根跑半圈", "en": "I run half around the roots."},
        {"zh": "我拖着尾巴跳过小沟。", "en": "I drag my tail over the ditch."},
        {"zh": "我贴着草地快速移动", "en": "I move fast along the grass."},
        {"zh": "我又窜上另一棵树", "en": "I dart up another tree."},
        {"zh": "我拖着尾巴跳过去", "en": "I jump with my tail trailing."},
